// A standing jump on the Playground's floor (by the start). Reference: research/dishonored/
// INSTRUMENTATION.md, first measurements (2026-10-06): apex 106.67 uu at 60 Hz.
// The measured launch speed (800, `Velocity.Z` "on the first airborne frame") is not checked
// here: the port's trace samples after the whole jump tick, physFalling included (800 - 2 g dt =
// 750), and which point of the tick the hook read is not recorded (U-763). The apex depends on
// the launch speed and agrees.
(
    name: "playground/jump_apex",
    system: Movement,
    map: "Playground",
    description: "Settle half a second, one jump press: apex height on a layout floor.",
    setup: (player: Some((position: (0, -5000, 92), yaw: 90))),
    ticks: 90,
    input: [(tick: 30, action: Press(Jump))],
    checkpoints: [
        (name: "apex", expect: [(metric: RiseFrom("pawn.z", 30), value: 106.67, tol: 1, source: "INSTRUMENTATION.md 2026-10-06: parabola fit over 4 jumps")]),
    ],
    record: [Pawn],
)
